# Raw netdata archives. Too large to commit; they live in S3, see README.
# Kept here so the upload script and any re-analysis run inside the repo's devshell,
# which is where awscli2 and credentials are.
#
# Pattern rather than explicit names so a new archive directory cannot be committed
# by accident; data-weekend/ was created after this file and was briefly uncovered.
data-1s/
data-1s-wide/
data-*/

# Generated from findings.md by scripts/build-artifact.sh; rebuild rather than commit.
findings.html
findings-artifact.html
